## Core Principles
Use latest Ponder package (no @ponder/core), define clear indexing strategies

## Ponder Configuration
Define networks/transports using http() from viem, specify contracts with start blocks

## Schema Design
Define tables with onchainTable(), use meaningful primary keys, use index() for frequently queried columns

## Performance
Cache frequently accessed data, batch database operations

